# Efterlev — local provenance store, scan caches, redaction audit log,
# and report artifacts. Manifests under .efterlev/manifests/ ARE
# committed (they're customer-authored evidence); everything else is
# runtime state recreated on every scan. Patterns use **/ because the
# .efterlev/ workspace lives under infra/terraform/, not repo root.
**/.efterlev/cache/
**/.efterlev/store/
**/.efterlev/store.db
**/.efterlev/store.db-journal
**/.efterlev/store.db-shm
**/.efterlev/store.db-wal
**/.efterlev/receipts.log
**/.efterlev/redactions/
**/.efterlev/reports/
**/.efterlev/config.toml

